&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Warsaw, Vienna, Berlin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stack:&lt;/strong&gt; Linux, AWS/GCP/Azure, BGP/OSPF, IaC, Datacenter Hardware&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contract:&lt;/strong&gt; B2B, Full-Time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🚀&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Join fiskaly! Help Us Build Trust in Compliance &amp;amp; Security&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every scalable, secure, and efficient product squad relies on a rock-solid infrastructure foundation. We are building resilient network and hardware layers that allow our platforms to operate securely and without avoidable operational disruption. We are looking for a Senior Hybrid Infrastructure Engineer who wants to take ownership of our foundational infrastructure. You will operate at the intersection of physical hardware and cloud environments, bringing reliability, advanced automation, and intelligent design to our core networks and datacenters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;💼&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;As a Senior individual contributor, you will be responsible for the design, operation, and evolution of our organization’s foundational infrastructure layers. You will not just maintain the status quo; you will own the standards for hyperscaler organization structure, network segmentation, and infrastructure automation across all environments. You will hold administrative access to cloud landing zones, network devices, core routing services, and bare-metal hosts. Working across both physical and virtual infrastructure layers, you will meticulously plan live system maintenance, verify operational readiness, and ensure that our core network paths and datacenter connectivity remain highly stable with minimal unplanned downtime.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🛠️&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Hybrid Connectivity Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the design and maintenance of hybrid cloud connectivity, enterprise routing, failover patterns, and datacenter-to-hyperscaler interconnects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Standardize &amp;amp; Automate:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the standards for hyperscaler structures, network segmentation, and infrastructure automation. Maintain accurate infrastructure inventory, topology documentation, and operational runbooks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Datacenter Operations:&lt;/strong&gt; Guide hardware lifecycle planning, rack readiness, cabling standards, and physical deployment quality across datacenters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Reliability &amp;amp; Capacity Planning:&lt;/strong&gt; Review and improve system reliability, capacity planning, and risk management. You will proactively scale and document hybrid infrastructure architecture before bottlenecks emerge.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strategic Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with Platform Engineering, Security, and application teams to expose infrastructure capabilities in a secure, consistent, and sustainable way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Disciplined Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Execute critical infrastructure changes prioritizing safety and operational readiness. Support structured change reviews, maintenance planning, and rigorous change control practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;✨&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Deep Technical Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Advanced expertise in Linux/Unix administration, cloud platforms (AWS, GCP, Azure), and enterprise networking protocols (BGP/OSPF).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Hybrid Infrastructure Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong practical experience with cloud landing zone design, network topology management, hybrid interconnect design, and datacenter hardware operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Automation &amp;amp; AI Literacy:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficient in Infrastructure as Code and configuration automation. You intelligently leverage AI-assisted tooling for network diagnostics and automation while maintaining strict review discipline and awareness of AI-generated risks in privileged tooling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Safety-Conscious Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Highly methodical and detail-oriented. You possess a strong sense of ownership and change discipline for live system maintenance and production network changes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Proven Track Record:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience heavily contributing to production hybrid infrastructure at scale. You have successfully reduced manual effort through standardization and executed low-risk infrastructure projects (such as secure datacenter-to-cloud migrations).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Effective Communication &amp;amp; Mentorship:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to troubleshoot production-grade issues under pressure. You clearly communicate capacity, risk, and downtime planning with stakeholders and naturally mentor peers in infrastructure best practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;💡&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;High-Impact Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Administrative authority over cloud landing zones, network devices, bare-metal hosts, and core routing services to shape the foundation of our platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;A Culture of Engineering Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; An environment that values clean topology modeling, resilient routing, and automation over manual configuration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; A highly collaborative setup working alongside Platform Engineering and product squads to deliver secure, foundational capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strategic Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Opportunities to lead massive infrastructure projects and migrations with high visibility and business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Proactive Over Reactive Environment:&lt;/strong&gt; A focus on scaling architecture and capacity proactively, ensuring the network remains stable without constant firefighting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Flexibility &amp;amp; Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Modern tooling, structured operational readiness checks, and a strong culture of autonomy and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🌍&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Why fiskaly?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re not just building tech,&amp;nbsp; we’re shaping the future of digital compliance. At fiskaly, we believe in trust, shared vision, and celebrating success together. If you want to grow your career where security meets innovation, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Über die Position: Was steckt in der Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als Senior Workforce Production Planner (all genders) stellst du sicher, dass unsere Produktionskapazitäten und Personalressourcen optimal auf den geplanten Produktionsbedarf abgestimmt sind. Du übersetzt Produktionsvolumen und Forecasts in konkrete Produktions-, Kapazitäts- und Personalpläne und sorgst dafür, dass die richtigen Mitarbeitenden zur richtigen Zeit mit den benötigten Qualifikationen verfügbar sind.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dein Schwerpunkt liegt auf der mittel- und kurzfristigen Produktionsplanung sowie der Personal- und Kapazitätsplanung. Du erkennst frühzeitig Engpässe, bewertest unterschiedliche Planungsszenarien und entwickelst gemeinsam mit den operativen Teams Lösungen, um unsere Produktionsziele zuverlässig zu erreichen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dabei arbeitest du eng mit Production, Workforce Planning und weiteren relevanten Schnittstellen zusammen und schaffst eine belastbare Planungsgrundlage für einen effizienten Produktionsablauf.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Aufgabenbereich: Das Rezept&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produktionsplanung: Du erstellst und optimierst Produktionspläne auf Basis von Forecasts und Produktionsanforderungen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personalplanung: Du leitest den Personalbedarf aus Produktionsvolumen, Schichtmodellen und Produktivitätskennzahlen ab und stimmst ihn mit den verfügbaren Ressourcen ab.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kapazitätsplanung: Du analysierst Produktionskapazitäten, erkennst Engpässe frühzeitig und entwickelst Lösungen zur optimalen Auslastung.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance &amp;amp; Optimierung: Du analysierst Plan-Ist-Abweichungen und entwickelst Maßnahmen zur Verbesserung der Planung und Produktivität.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Zusammenarbeit: Du koordinierst dich mit Production, Workforce Planning und weiteren Schnittstellen, um eine verlässliche und umsetzbare Planung sicherzustellen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Was du mitbringst: Die Zutaten&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–5+ Jahre Erfahrung in Production Planning, Resource Planning, Scheduling oder Workforce Management, idealerweise in einem dynamischen, volumenstarken Umfeld wie Manufacturing, FMCG oder E-Commerce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein ausgeprägtes Verständnis für Kapazitätsplanung, Ressourcensteuerung und operative Zusammenhänge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sehr gute Deutsch- und Englischkenntnisse in Wort und Schrift.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du kannst komplexe Daten und Abhängigkeiten analysieren und daraus klare, umsetzbare Entscheidungen ableiten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du hast eine Hands-on Mentalität und Freude daran, operative Herausforderungen nicht nur zu analysieren, sondern konkrete Lösungen umzusetzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bieten wir Dir&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Einen Wohlfühlarbeitsplatz mit einem tollen Team in Barleben bei Magdeburg&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rabatteauf unsere HelloFresh Kochboxen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weiterentwicklungsmöglichkeitendurch interne Trainings sowie ein jährliches Team-Budget für Weiterbildung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein umfassendes Onboarding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein kompetitives Gehalt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 Tage Urlaub&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spaß bei Teamevents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vergünstigte Fitnessangebote bei Urban Sports Club bzw. John Reed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Initiativen für das Wohlbefinden durch Kooperationen mit der Headspace-App und Spill&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Betriebliche Altersvorsorge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Selgros Karte&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Persönliche Sicherheitsausrüstung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Du bist auch hungrig nach mehr?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bewirb Dich jetzt mit Deinen vollständigen Bewerbungsunterlagen, gerne auch ohne Lichtbild und ohne Angabe von spezifischen Merkmalen wie Nationalität oder Geschlecht. Sprachzertifikate und Unterlagen zur Aufenthalts- und Arbeitserlaubnis können gerne mit eingereicht werden.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir freuen uns auf Dich!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 212, 217);&quot;&gt;#JD1001&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 212, 217);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(206, 212, 217);&quot;&gt;#barnoffice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Stark, we forge the future of European and national security through cutting-edge, AI-driven technology and unmatched engineering precision. As a premier defence technology company, our mission is clear: to equip NATO Allies and their partners &amp;nbsp;with next-generation autonomous defence platforms and advanced AI-driven software built to perform in the world’s most demanding environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We believe that true security stems from relentless innovation. By combining elite engineering talent with agile technology and an AI-native operational culture, Stark turns complex defence challenges into field-tested, multi-domain solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;WHY JOIN US&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The software and systems you work on directly protect personnel and defend European and national sovereignty.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will work alongside industry-leading minds on autonomous systems, advanced propulsion, and secure cyber platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We foster a fast-paced, collaborative environment where bold ideas are supported by serious R&amp;amp;D backing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a cross-functional engineering team powering our Counter-Unmanned Aerial Systems (C-UAS) program. Built on the background of the Minerva Edge CTRL team, our engineers create onboard edge software and integrated systems across core STARK platforms, delivering dependable performance when timing and accuracy matter most. Today, we are building the next-generation stack and physical integration for the STARK C-UAS platform at the intersection of hardware, real-time embedded systems, computer vision, and AI-driven navigation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Drone Engineer Working Student for Dragonfly, your mission is to bring our autonomous C-UAS systems to life in the physical world. Serving as a vital link between hardware development and software execution, you will assemble and refine our aerial platforms, design mechanical and electrical solutions, and build critical testing environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU WILL DO AT STARK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drone Assembly &amp;amp; Prototyping: Work closely alongside hardware engineers to assemble, wire, configure, and maintain C-UAS drone platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Electro-Mechanical Engineering: Tackle hands-on electrical and mechanical challenges, from circuit troubleshooting and sensor integration to structural adjustments and payload mounting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CAD &amp;amp; Prototyping: Utilize CAD/EDA tools to creatively prototype and iterate custom mechanical and hardware solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;QA Testing &amp;amp; Simulation: Conduct Quality Assurance testing on physical drone hardware and software integration, while maintaining Hardware-in-the-Loop (HiTL) and Software-in-the-Loop (SiTL) test environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Field Operations &amp;amp; Inventory: Support live flight-test campaigns in the field and manage procurement workflows and inventory for lab equipment and R&amp;amp;D parts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING TO THE MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Academic Background: Enrolled in a Bachelor’s or Master’s program in Aerospace, Mechanical, Electrical Engineering, Mechatronics, Robotics, or a related discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-On Hardware Skills: Practical familiarity with electronics, soldering, wiring, workshop tools, and mechanical assembly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineering Fundamentals: Solid foundation in mechanical/electrical engineering principles and eager to learn CAD/design software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Availability &amp;amp; Mindset: Pragmatic troubleshooting mindset, available up to 20 hours/week during semesters, and willingness to support local field testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NICE TO HAVE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior UAV / Robotics Experience: Building, maintaining, or piloting drones (FPV, multirotor, fixed-wing).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flight Control &amp;amp; Autopilot: Familiarity with PX4, ArduPilot, Betaflight, or ground control stations like QGroundControl.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design &amp;amp; Software Tools: SolidWorks, Fusion 360, KiCad, 3D printing, Linux, Python/C++, or ROS/ROS2.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If you&#39;re interested in building the future of European Defence with us, and you see yourself reflected on the description above, please send us your &lt;strong&gt;CV in English&lt;/strong&gt;. We&#39;re looking forward to meeting you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SECURITY CLEARANCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Due to the nature of our work in the defence sector, candidates must be eligible to obtain and maintain the appropriate security clearance required for this position. Details will be provided during the recruitment process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive workplace. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, colour, religion, sex, national origin, disability, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

