&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Prior engineering experience in aerospace, autonomous driving, robotics, or defence industries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
