&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supervise and Train: &lt;/strong&gt;Mentor and supervise graduate engineers, fostering their professional development and integration into the team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
