&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;A collaborative and inclusive working environment where technical excellence is valued and rewarded.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
