&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burson, part of WPP, is the global communications leader built to create value for clients through reputation. With highly specialized teams, industry-leading technologies and breakthrough creative, we help brands and businesses redefine reputation as a competitive advantage so they can lead today and into the future. When you work at Burson, you are part of a global community of lifelong learners who thrive at the edge of innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP (LSE/NYSE: WPP) is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;WPP.com&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/&quot;&gt;bursonglobal.com&lt;/a&gt; and follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/burson/posts/?feedView=all&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/burson.global/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More about the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burson Buchanan is a strategic advisory boutique that counsels clients on major capital markets events, ongoing financial communications, high-profile litigation and government investigations, crises and other reputation-defining events. We combine specialist advice with the reach of Burson’s global network and its data, analytics and AI tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Managing Director, you will build, launch and scale our Litigation Communications practice, starting in London and expanding into priority European markets as the practice grows. You will drive new business, advise boards, executive teams and legal counsel on contentious matters, and lead teams through complex, high-profile mandates. You will also support clients facing high-stakes capital markets events, crises and other special situations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will build on Burson Buchanan’s established US litigation communications expertise and work with Burson colleagues across the UK, Europe and the wider global network to serve priority clients and pursue new business together. As a member of the Burson Buchanan Senior Leadership Team, you will help shape the firm’s strategy and build a culture of high performance, teamwork and open, respectful feedback.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Launch and grow the practice.&lt;/strong&gt; Define and execute the go-to-market strategy for Litigation Communications, establishing the offer in London and developing opportunities in Europe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Counsel senior clients on contentious matters.&lt;/strong&gt; Advise boards, C-suite executives, general counsel and external legal counsel on securities and financial litigation, competition and antitrust matters, government and regulatory investigations, white-collar and whistleblower cases, intellectual property and trade secrets disputes, class actions and collective proceedings, US multidistrict litigation, and employment and labour disputes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead complex mandates from strategy through delivery.&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee litigation, investigations, crisis and special situations accounts. Set the communications strategy, mobilise teams quickly and stay hands-on with critical deliverables, taking responsibility for the quality of the work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Originate and win new business.&lt;/strong&gt; Build a referral pipeline through relationships with law firm partners, litigators, litigation funders, general counsel and board-level contacts. Lead pitches and responses to requests for proposals, and convert opportunities into revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow client relationships across Burson.&lt;/strong&gt; Introduce litigation communications to existing corporate and financial communications clients and bring Burson’s corporate affairs, public affairs and investor relations expertise to disputes clients. Work across offices and practices on priority accounts and prospects, drawing on Burson’s crisis and regulatory expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use data and AI to strengthen client advice.&lt;/strong&gt; Work with Burson specialists to apply intelligence, analytics and AI tools to sensitive mandates, helping teams use WPP-approved tools responsibly and in line with relevant ethical standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and lead the team.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Recruit, develop and mentor specialist advisers as the practice grows. Contribute to firm-wide strategy, operations, talent development and long-term positioning through the Burson Buchanan Senior Leadership Team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Burson Buchanan’s profile in the legal market.&lt;/strong&gt; Publish thought leadership, provide media commentary and represent the firm at legal industry events through speaking, panel participation, sponsorship and senior networking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience that contributes to success:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Substantial senior advisory experience in strategic communications, including current or previous agency or consultancy experience and a track record of leading communications on high-profile litigation, disputes or government and regulatory investigations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience advising boards, C-suite executives, general counsel and external legal counsel, with the judgement and discretion to align communications with legal strategy on sensitive matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading complex, fast-moving mandates from strategy through execution, with strong writing and editing skills and the ability to explain legal, regulatory and financial issues clearly to different audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An established referral network among law firm partners, litigators and in-house legal leaders in London, with relationships that can support the practice’s growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A demonstrable record of originating and converting new business, leading competitive pitches and proposals, and generating revenue through new mandates and the growth of existing client relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or expanding a specialist advisory practice or service, shaping its market offer and raising its profile through thought leadership, media engagement or industry events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading teams on complex assignments and drawing on expertise across disciplines such as crisis, corporate affairs, public affairs, financial communications and investor relations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building and developing advisory teams, coaching colleagues and setting high standards for client work while remaining hands-on with critical deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-NE1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You belong at Burson:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our vision is for Burson to be the leading ‘academy company’ for creative communications professionals and emerging leaders. We provide a dynamic environment where ambitious colleagues come to elevate their skills, expand their networks, and ultimately, produce the best solutions for today’s leading brands. Our commitment to your growth is reflected in our robust benefits and people programs, which include professional development opportunities, mentorship programs with industry leaders, a vibrant and inclusive company culture fostering collaboration and innovation and packages designed to reward and retain top talent. We invest in our people because we believe their success is our success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Burson, we’re an agency of learn-it-alls. We recognize that the things we do best, creativity and communications, require a level of nuanced understanding. That’s why it’s imperative for us to hire extraordinarily talented people of all backgrounds and identities. Without that we can’t do the essential work of inspiring bold ideas, fostering constructive dialogue, cultivating meaningful experiences, and driving innovation and creativity for our partners. Your unique point of view—your talent—is what makes you a #BursonPerson, and it’s how we deliver exceptional results for our clients, together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button below, this will send any information you add below to Burson. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy. &lt;/a&gt;California residents should read our  &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice. &lt;/a&gt;This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Burson, part of WPP, is the global communications leader built to create value for clients through reputation. With highly specialized teams, industry-leading technologies and breakthrough creative, we help brands and businesses redefine reputation as a competitive advantage so they can lead today and into the future. When you work at Burson, you are part of a global community of lifelong learners who thrive at the edge of innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP (LSE/NYSE: WPP) is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;WPP.com&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/&quot;&gt;bursonglobal.com&lt;/a&gt; and follow us on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/burson/posts/?feedView=all&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/burson.global/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More about the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a&amp;nbsp;Managing Director&amp;nbsp;at Burson Buchanan, you will be a principal growth engine, client counsellor, and key leader within our premier strategic advisory boutique. Burson Buchanan delivers high-level advisory and communications support to clients on major capital markets events, ongoing financial communications, high-profile litigation and government investigations, crises and other reputation-defining events. Backed by Burson’s global network and market-leading data, analytics and AI tools, Burson Buchanan is defining strategic communications advisory for the intelligence era.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a&amp;nbsp;business generator, you will leverage your deep network of relationships within the advisory community, including leading investment banks, law firms and other advisory firms and in the executive ranks and boardrooms of leading companies to help originate new business leads and opportunities. As a&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;s&lt;/strong&gt;trategic senior counsellor, you will oversee accounts and lead teams in responding to the market-shaping events faced by Burson Buchanan clients, ensuring we consistently deliver excellent client work while driving sustainable account growth and long-term client retention.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a member of the Burson Buchanan&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Senior Leadership Team (SLT), you will help shape the strategic direction of the firm. Leading by example, you will set the tone for a team culture that is built on high performance, teamwork, and open and respectful feedback to continue to elevate the value we bring to clients&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide trusted counsel to C-suite executives and boards on complex capital markets activity, including M&amp;amp;A, IPOs and shareholder activism, and on high-stakes reputational issues, including crises and litigation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex client accounts and major transactions, shaping strategic positioning and overseeing execution and quality across all deliverables. Move from board-level counsel to hands-on delivery and take ownership of client and firm-wide challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of global capital markets trends, macroeconomic drivers, regulatory shifts and competitive developments, applying these insights to client mandates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position Burson Buchanan as the UK’s premier strategic communications adviser by combining capital markets expertise with Burson’s AI tools and drawing on its global network to support clients on cross-border financial and corporate communications challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Originate and convert high-value new business aligned with the firm’s commercial priorities. Identify cross-selling opportunities across Burson and WPP to bring multidisciplinary expertise to capital markets clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Burson Buchanan through market commentary, industry events and senior-level networking, raising the firm’s profile and building its new business pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to agency-wide strategy, operational excellence, talent strategy and long-term positioning as an active member of the Senior Leadership Team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Line manage and mentor talent in the financial communications practice, supporting career growth and retention. Set the standard for ambition, strategic thinking and commercial urgency while fostering connection and respect.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the adoption of innovative client solutions, including AI-driven communications tools, and ensure the team follows WPP requirements for tool use, ethical frameworks and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience that contributes to success:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Current or previous experience in a strategic communications agency or consultancy, with direct responsibility for advising clients on capital markets communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of leading communications on major capital markets mandates, such as M&amp;amp;A, IPOs and shareholder activism, backed by a strong understanding of global markets, regulatory developments and macroeconomic trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A demonstrable record of originating high-value new business, leading pitches and converting opportunities into client mandates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An established network of senior relationships across investment banks, law firms and other advisory firms, as well as with C-suite executives and board members, and experience turning those relationships into new business opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience advising C-suite executives and boards on complex transactions and sensitive reputational matters, such as crises, litigation or regulatory investigations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of leading complex client accounts and deal teams, taking a hands-on role in critical deliverables and growing and retaining client relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience drawing on international and multidisciplinary teams to deliver financial communications advice across jurisdictions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior leadership experience shaping agency strategy, line managing and mentoring advisers, and building a high-performing team that values collaboration and constructive feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-NE1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You belong at Burson:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our vision is for Burson to be the leading ‘academy company’ for creative communications professionals and emerging leaders. We provide a dynamic environment where ambitious colleagues come to elevate their skills, expand their networks, and ultimately, produce the best solutions for today’s leading brands. Our commitment to your growth is reflected in our robust benefits and people programs, which include professional development opportunities, mentorship programs with industry leaders, a vibrant and inclusive company culture fostering collaboration and innovation and packages designed to reward and retain top talent. We invest in our people because we believe their success is our success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Burson, we’re an agency of learn-it-alls. We recognize that the things we do best, creativity and communications, require a level of nuanced understanding. That’s why it’s imperative for us to hire extraordinarily talented people of all backgrounds and identities. Without that we can’t do the essential work of inspiring bold ideas, fostering constructive dialogue, cultivating meaningful experiences, and driving innovation and creativity for our partners. Your unique point of view—your talent—is what makes you a #BursonPerson, and it’s how we deliver exceptional results for our clients, together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button below, this will send any information you add below to Burson. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy. &lt;/a&gt;California residents should read our  &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bursonglobal.com/p/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice. &lt;/a&gt;This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Since we opened our doors in 2009, the world of commerce has evolved immensely, and so has Square. After enabling anyone to take payments and never miss a sale, we saw sellers stymied by disparate, outmoded products and tools that wouldn&#39;t work together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;So we expanded into software and started building integrated, omnichannel solutions – to help sellers sell online, manage inventory, offer buy now, pay later functionality, book appointments, engage loyal buyers, and hire and pay staff. Across it all, we&#39;ve embedded financial services tools at the point of sale, so merchants can access a business loan and manage their cash flow in one place. Afterpay furthers our goal to provide omnichannel tools that unlock meaningful value and growth, enabling sellers to capture the next generation shopper, increase order sizes, and compete at a larger scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, we are a partner to sellers of all sizes – large, enterprise-scale businesses with complex operations, sellers just starting, as well as merchants who began selling with Square and have grown larger over time. As our sellers grow, so do our solutions. There is a massive opportunity in front of us. We&#39;re building a significant, meaningful, and lasting business, and we are helping sellers worldwide do the same.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Square is looking for a team-oriented Account Executive that&#39;s excited to grow with us and make an impact on our UK business. This role provides the opportunity for you to refine your sales acumen, collaborate with your direct team and cross-functional teams, and work closely with hundreds of inspiring entrepreneurs and business owners. Through your extraordinary communication skills, you will connect with customers to sell the value of Square to their business - quickly establishing trust and successfully building upon your relationships throughout the sales process. You&#39;re a great fit for this role if you&#39;ve got an entrepreneurial spirit, a growth-oriented mindset and an innate knack for collaborative problem-solving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate and introduce the value of Square to SMB/MM merchants within the UK&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the sales cycle from prospecting to close&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with cross-functional teams to ensure successful onboarding for your customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a keen understanding of your pipeline and the necessary sales activities in order to achieve and exceed sales targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate strong customer intuition and take a consultative approach to every conversation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product and Marketing teams to ensure Square is meeting the unique needs of the UK market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with your team to both replicate successes across the team and to identify opportunities for improvement that drive impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize your prior sales experience to get off the ground running with a creative pipeline strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in a closing or 360 account executive role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A BA/BS degree or relevant experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience or an interest in helping SMB sellers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of the importance of value-selling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of exceeding sales targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A structured thought process with the ability to assess business opportunities and read prospective buyers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to gather support from internal experts and external partners to position Square against our competitors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine curiosity about people, business, and can inspire this passion in others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in seeking out and implementing feedback, and dedication to the improvement of your craft&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tenacity and an ability to adapt to new situations quickly and think on your feet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent collaboration and communication skills that help you connect with customers by email and phone to establish trust and credibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to drive deals independently in a fast-paced, dynamic environment Business development experience (e.g. hunting and cold calling)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative and team player mentality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior Salesforce experience or equivalent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re working to build a more inclusive economy where our customers have equal access to opportunity, and we strive to live by these same values in building our workplace. Block is a proud equal opportunity employer. We work hard to evaluate all employees and job applicants consistently, based solely on the core competencies required of the role at hand, and without regard to any legally protected class. We believe in being fair, and are committed to an inclusive interview experience, including providing reasonable accommodations to disabled applicants throughout the recruitment process. We encourage applicants to share any needed accommodations with their recruiter, who will treat these requests as confidentially as possible. &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Want to learn more about what we&#39;re doing to build an inclusive workplace? Check out our &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/news/inclusion&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Inclusion &amp;amp; Diversity page&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Guidelines&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates may submit up to 9 active applications within a 60-day period. Reapplications to the same role are accepted 90 days after a previous application has been reviewed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of AI in Our Hiring Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We may use automated AI tools to evaluate job applications for efficiency and consistency. These tools comply with local regulations, including bias audits, and we handle all personal data in accordance with state and local privacy laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contact us &lt;a href=&quot;https://privacy.block.xyz/privacyportal/form&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;with hiring practice or data usage questions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Every benefit we offer is designed with one goal: empowering you to do the best work of your career while building the life you want. Remote work, medical insurance, flexible time off, retirement savings plans, and modern family planning are just some of our offering.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://block.xyz/employee-benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://block.xyz/documents/benefits.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Check out our other benefits at Block.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Block, Inc. (NYSE: XYZ) builds technology to increase access to the global economy. Each of our brands unlocks different aspects of the economy for more people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Square&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;makes commerce and financial services accessible to sellers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Cash App&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is the easy way to spend, send, and store money.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Afterpay&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is transforming the way customers manage their spending over time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;TIDAL&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a music platform that empowers artists to thrive as entrepreneurs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Bitkey&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a simple self-custody wallet built for bitcoin.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Proto&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a suite of bitcoin mining products and services. Together, we’re helping build a financial system that is open to everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/en/legal/applicant-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Firmus Technologies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Firmus Technologies is a global leader pioneering the development and operation of efficient AI infrastructure across Asia Pacific.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Founded in Australia in 2019, our mission is to create the most efficient AI infrastructure by combining cutting-edge technology with a steadfast commitment to sustainability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;At Firmus, we are unique in our approach. We design, build, and operate a new class of digital infrastructure – the AI Factory. Through our model-to-grid technology approach, we have pushed the boundaries of multi-generational liquid cooling systems, energy management, AI software orchestration, and construction. For our customers, this approach allows us to make every watt count and deliver low-cost AI tokens globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Firmus AI Cloud&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Our large-scale GPU cloud platform, Firmus AI Cloud, is purpose-built to deliver energy-efficient AI compute at scale to customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;It empowers developers, enterprises, educational institutions, and government users to train and deploy AI models with unmatched efficiency and cost savings. With an ever-growing suite of services and applications, we are committed to delivering a cloud experience that is market-leading, proprietary, and built to scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Firmus?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;As an NVIDIA Cloud and Engineering partner in Asia Pacific, you will gain skills, experience, and exposure across the AI industry and be part of shaping what this industry looks like for decades to come.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;We are founder-led, not a big corporate. Decisions happen fast, our leaders are accessible, and there&#39;s minimum bureaucracy between you and the work. Ownership comes early. Whatever your role, you will have a direct line to outcomes, helping shape how the business grows as we scale nationally across a long-term, large-scale roadmap.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Work alongside founders and experts in AI infrastructure, energy systems and next-generation compute.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;What we build here has impact beyond the business. Our AI Factories are designed to operate as assets to the energy grid to actively strengthen the communities and regions they operate in rather than drawing from them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Considering applying? You don&#39;t need a perfect background to join our team. If you&#39;re driven and curious, there&#39;s a path for you. We back our people to grow into new domains and take on challenges beyond their previous experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Legal Counsel: Infrastructure and Construction is a senior member of the Legal team, responsible for providing strategic, commercially focused legal support across Firmus&#39; operations, infrastructure, procurement and supply chain activities. Reporting to the General Counsel, the role serves as a trusted adviser to business leaders on complex legal, commercial and operational matters, helping the Company identify opportunities, manage risk and execute on its growth strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with teams across procurement, projects, operations, development, energy and commercial functions, the Senior Legal Counsel will support the contracting, delivery and operation of critical infrastructure that underpins Firmus&#39; AI Factory platform. The role will lead legal support for significant commercial and project-related arrangements, negotiate complex agreements and provide practical, solutions-oriented advice in a fast-paced, high-growth technology environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate will combine strong technical legal expertise with commercial judgment, a collaborative approach and the ability to operate autonomously across a broad range of matters. This is an opportunity to work on industry-leading projects at the intersection of artificial intelligence, digital infrastructure, energy and technology while contributing to the growth of one of the region&#39;s most innovative infrastructure platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Construction and infrastructure projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Property transactions, leasing and development matters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supply chain, procurement and strategic sourcing arrangements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Power, energy and utilities agreements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Insurance, claims and risk management matters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Legal risk management and regulatory compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Development and maintenance of legal templates, policies and frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 8-10 years&#39; post-qualification experience (PQE).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience gained in a top-tier law firm and/or a sophisticated in-house legal environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience across construction, property, supply chain, procurement, energy, utilities, insurance and commercial contracting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to negotiate and manage complex commercial and project arrangements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial judgment and pragmatic approach to legal risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate autonomously and provide clear, solutions-focused advice in a fast-paced, growth-oriented business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management, communication and negotiation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Desirable Experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in technology, digital infrastructure, telecommunications, energy, utilities, logistics or data centre sectors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting large-scale operational and capital project environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor of Laws (LLB), Juris Doctor (JD) or equivalent legal qualification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Admission as a legal practitioner in Australia and eligibility to hold a practising certificate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location &amp;amp; Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt; Sydney, Melbourne or Singapore&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Reports to:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt; General Counsel and Company Secretary&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Basis&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Permanent full-time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;At Firmus, we are committed to building a diverse and inclusive workplace. We encourage applications from candidates of all backgrounds who are passionate about creating a more sustainable future through innovative engineering solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Join us in our mission to revolutionise the AI industry through sustainable practices and cutting-edge engineering. Apply now to be part of shaping the future of sustainable AI infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

