&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Director, Marketing Events is a hands-on leader of Inizio’s congress and events activation, a critical part of the Marketing strategy. The role owns Inizio’s flagship congresses and industry events and sets the events playbook and shared vendors for Business Unit events, ensuring every event supports Inizio’s marketing strategy and growth priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role is central to Inizio’s integrated global marketing function, running events as a single program in which every event is linked to a campaign, to meetings with priority accounts and to a measured return. Building on strong existing events, the Director leads and develops the Marketing Events team as the program scales, setting its standards and overseeing delivery, and leads the global marketing team on site at key events.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of the Global Marketing Leadership team, the Director works closely with colleagues across the function. Driven by Inizio’s purpose to reimagine health, the role champions Intelligent Commercialization™ from discovery to post-launch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop the Marketing Events team, setting team standards as the program scales and overseeing the delivery team and its agency partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align Inizio’s event presence to the marketing strategy, ensuring a clear and consistent go-to-market presence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own flagship congresses and industry events, delivering a single integrated Inizio presence at each and maintaining the master event calendar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide visible leadership on site at key congresses and events, as part of the global marketing leadership team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver BU activation slots at flagship congresses centrally, and manage attendee readiness before, during and after each event&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver Inizio-hosted events and webinars, and showcase Inizio’s congress expertise, including the Intelligent Congress offering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the events playbook and negotiated vendor rates for BU-only events, support lean BUs to run them end to end, and provide a named event lead for each BU&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own event ROI, tracking attendee targeting, meetings and pipeline against a single standard and reporting through the marketing ROI dashboard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the events budget, vendors and event contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with BU Marketing Leads, Commercial, Communications and Marketing Operations, influencing without direct authority so events support pipeline and tell one Inizio story&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uphold Inizio’s brand, values and standards in all internal and external work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record in B2B marketing or in running large events in the marketing space, ideally in health, life sciences or professional services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercially minded, linking events to pipeline and ROI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management skills, influencing BU leaders without direct authority and building senior relationships with clients and partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organized and calm under pressure, managing a complex calendar of events and budgets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leads and develops teams and agency partners, setting high standards and best practice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative judgment and attention to detail, with a high standard for the quality of events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uses AI and embeds it into workflows as part of continuous improvement, raising quality and efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth marketing mindset, with experience using campaigns, data and testing to drive demand and pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable in a fast-paced, matrixed, global organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Required&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marketing Events Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of B2B marketing experience, or of running large events in the marketing space, including senior leadership of events, teams and agencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Events and Congresses&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience planning and delivering flagship events, congresses or large conferences at global scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience linking events to campaigns, account meetings and pipeline, and measuring return&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing event budgets and agency and vendor partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partnerships and Measurement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building partnerships and sponsorships with industry bodies and third parties&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using marketing reporting to measure impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in B2B professional services, ideally in health or life sciences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Desirable&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of the pharma congress calendar and of life sciences clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI tools in event planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a global, multi-business-unit organization going through integration or transformation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A single integrated marketing events program, with a playbook agreed with the BU Marketing Leads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Return measured for every event against a single standard, and growing event-sourced pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meetings with priority accounts held at flagship congresses and events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Events delivered on time and within budget, with strong client and attendee feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnerships that raise Inizio’s profile with target clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Marketing event plans clearly aligned to Inizio’s marketing strategy, with a measurable contribution to growth marketing goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Inizio, we want you to feel supported both professionally and personally. Our benefits are designed to support your health, wellbeing and financial future, while giving you flexibility in how you work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on your location and employing entity, our benefits include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Private Healthcare&lt;/strong&gt; – access to private healthcare or a healthcare allowance, depending on your location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pension&lt;/strong&gt; – a company-supported pension scheme with employer contributions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Annual Leave&lt;/strong&gt; – 25 days&#39; annual leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid Working&lt;/strong&gt; – a flexible working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life Insurance&lt;/strong&gt; – cover of 4x your basic salary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Income Protection&lt;/strong&gt; – up to 75% of your basic salary in the event of eligible long-term sickness or absence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Assistance Programme&lt;/strong&gt; – confidential support for personal, work and wellbeing concerns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cycle to Work&lt;/strong&gt; – support towards the cost of a bike and cycling equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Wellbeing &amp;amp; Lifestyle Benefits&lt;/strong&gt; – additional benefits may include eyecare, wellbeing resources and employee discounts, depending on your location and employing entity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Benefits vary by location and employing entity. We will provide full details during the recruitment process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Inizio&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Inizio, we&#39;re a global team motivated by a shared purpose: to reimagine health.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Formed in 2022, we unite decades of experience and expertise with data, technology, and AI. We create tailored solutions that drive Intelligent Commercialization™ at every stage of the journey, from discovery to post-launch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our global network of over 10,000 experts operates across 50 countries, supporting clients with strategic insight, medical excellence, creative engagement, and real-world delivery. We work with the world&#39;s leading health and life sciences businesses to solve complex challenges and accomplish meaningful outcomes for our clients and patients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What sets Inizio apart is our people - and we believe everyone should excel. Here, you&#39;re encouraged to reimagine your possibilities: to grow, to be curious and to make change happen. We value your individuality, support your development, and celebrate your ambition. If you&#39;re ready to push boundaries and accelerate your career, Inizio is the best place to be.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Pledge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Inizio, we value inclusivity, recognize the power of diversity and inspire the next generation of change-makers. We are an equal opportunities employer. We believe in creating a dynamic work environment that values diversity, equity and inclusion. We aim to recruit from a diverse slate of candidates and foster an environment that provides the right conditions for long-term success. We welcome all applications. We consider them regardless of race, color, religion, or belief. We also consider them regardless of gender, gender identity, age, national origin, marital status, military veteran status, genetic information, sexual orientation, and physical or mental disability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Artificial Intelligence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inizio may use AI technologies to support certain aspects of our recruitment process, but our human recruiting team makes all hiring decisions at Inizio. We are committed to fair, inclusive, and human-led hiring practices.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Don&#39;t meet every job requirement? That&#39;s okay! Our company is dedicated to building an inclusive and authentic workplace. If you&#39;re excited about this role, but your experience doesn&#39;t perfectly fit every qualification, we encourage you to apply anyway. You may be just the right person for this role or others.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Capgemini and Cambridge Consultants&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Cambridge Consultants (part of Capgemini Invent) develops breakthrough products, creates and licenses intellectual property, and provides business consultancy in technology-critical issues for clients worldwide. For more than 50 years, the company has been helping its clients turn business opportunities into commercial successes, whether they are launching first-to-market products, entering new markets, or expanding existing markets through the introduction of new technologies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Capgemini Group is a global leader in partnering with companies to transform and manage their business by harnessing the power of technology. The Group is guided every day by its purpose of unleashing human energy through technology for an inclusive and sustainable future. It is a responsible and diverse group of 340,000 team members in more than 50 countries, reporting 2025 Global revenues of €22.5 billion. With its strong 55+ year heritage, Capgemini is trusted by its clients to unlock the value of technology to address the entire breadth of their business needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Role Description&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Trusted AI and Secure Technologies (TASTE) group in Cambridge, UK provides advisory consulting and technical strategy and development for clients wishing to understand and leverage novel technologies for cybersecurity, AI assurance, post-quantum cryptography, and trusted digital-physical systems.&amp;nbsp; Our team provides technical consultancy in areas ranging from government policy to technology roadmaps, system architectures, testing, and post-quantum security migration for a wide range of clients, primarily in the critical national infrastructure and public sectors.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are looking for a talented, experienced engineering project leader with an interest in assessing, designing and implementing trusted systems and architectures. Particular areas of focus we are looking for include post-quantum cryptography, security approaches for combined IT/OT systems, AI-enabled cybersecurity, cybersecurity for AI systems.&amp;nbsp; Main sectors of interest are government/public sector (including defence and security), energy and utilities, smart infrastructure, and mobility, but we are also active in other sectors including healthcare, consumer, and bioinnovation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;In this role you will advise both CC clients and CC project teams on how to assess, design and develop appropriate security and assurance (both processes and technical approach) for both existing organisational networks and systems, and for novel applications, systems and devices.&amp;nbsp; This may involve both advisory work and actual design or development.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; A significant portion of time would be spent on leading client-facing work on post-quantum cryptography strategies, approaches and migration. There will also be opportunities to get involved in project bid development to provide technical advice on the feasibility and complexity of bids, and suggested solutions.&amp;nbsp; Some examples of recent work are linked below.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cambridgeconsultants.com/quantum-tools-to-tackle-the-cybersecurity-threat-to-energy/&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;Quantum tools to tackle the cybersecurity threat to energy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cambridgeconsultants.com/societal-energy-network-security-in-a-post-quantum-world/&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;Societal energy network security in a post quantum world&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
