&lt;li&gt;A background in Data &amp;amp; AI engineering or architecture, with sufficient technical depth to have client conversations, shape solutions, validate estimates, and review the work of nearshore and offshore teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience owning the delivery of a Data &amp;amp; AI engagement with a nearshore or offshore team, including scope, budget, escalations, and client steering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working directly with decision-makers and driving Data &amp;amp; AI programs from business case through to delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
