&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with financial services clients in Switzerland.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with legacy data warehouse migrations to Databricks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Databricks certification, or willingness to obtain certification within 3-6 months.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to practice building, for example through offerings, accelerators, talks, or mentoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
