&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Must currently hold valid work authorization for The Netherlands.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ability to work from our Barcelona office on a weekly basis under our hybrid model.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;Bonus points:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Event-driven architecture, asynchronous communication and messaging platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;REST API design, OpenAPI, API gateways and OAuth2/OIDC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azure or AWS, containers and Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
